    "title": "Networks director represents AKU at INQAAHE Conference in Chicago",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Dr Tashmin Khamis, Director of AKU Networks of Quality, Teaching and Learning, attended the 2015 INQAAHE (International Network for Quality Assurance Agencies in Higher Education) Conference in Chicago on March 30 to April 5.",
